OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Sunny
OL,7,Fspells for many, though these may turn
OL,8,Fhazy at times as areas of cloud drift
OL,9,Fthrough. Feeling warm where the
OL,10,Fsunshine emerges.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FSome late brightness to end
OL,13,FMonday, then clear spells and variable
OL,14,Fcloud overnight. Staying dry
OL,15,Fthroughout. Rather warm in urban areas
OL,16,Fbut fresher in rural locations.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
